                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 19]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">French Delegation Proposal Concerning Rail
                        Transit</hi></head>
                <p>The French Delegation considers it necessary to safeguard the Allied and
                    Associated Powers against possible ill-will on the part of ex-enemy States as
                    regards transit traffic. To allay any anxiety in this respect, the proposed
                    Article is very flexibly framed and offers the ex-enemy States the advantage of
                    reciprocity.</p>
            </div>
